{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01042","headline":"相和歌辞 江南曲八首 八 · 刘希夷","name":"相和歌辞 江南曲八首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔江南年盛时，平生怨在长洲曲。\n冠盖星繁湘水上，冲风摽落洞庭渌。\n落花舞袖红纷纷，朝霞高阁洗晴云。\n谁言此处婵娟子，珠玉爲心以奉君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}